# Scholarship detail slugs come from the title, so renaming a listing to its
# provider's real award name orphans the old URL. Every rename goes here as a
# 301 so indexed links and student bookmarks keep working.
#
# Every rule needs BOTH the slash and no-slash source. Cloudflare Pages only
# 308-normalises a bare path when the slashed page exists as a built asset —
# a renamed slug has no asset, so /old-slug fell through to a hard 404 while
# /old-slug/ redirected fine. Google had the no-slash form indexed (it was
# still earning clicks), so half of every rename below was being thrown away.

